# audiomancer MCP server demo
Output docs/assets/gifs/mcp-demo.gif

Set Shell "zsh"
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 900
Set Height 400
Set Padding 20

Type "cd ~/Development/audiomancer"
Enter
Sleep 500ms

Type "# Start MCP server for Claude integration"
Enter
Sleep 1s

Type "uv run audiomancer serve"
Enter
Sleep 2s

Ctrl+C
Sleep 500ms

Type "# MCP server provides tools for AI-assisted music production"
Enter
Sleep 1s

Type "# - search_samples: Find samples by query, BPM, key"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Type "# - generate_pattern: Create TidalCycles patterns"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Type "# - analyze_sample: Extract audio features"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Type "# - list_packs: Browse sample library"
Enter
Sleep 2s
